{"input":{"title":"Men's Bowling – League Night Is Not Optional Tee","handle":"mens-bowling-league-night-is-not-optional-graphic-tee","status":"DRAFT","vendor":"Graphic Tees Co.","productType":"T-Shirt","tags":["graphic-tees-for-men","funny-graphic-tees","retro-graphic-tees","ai-art","intake-done"],"descriptionHtml":"<h3>The Story</h3>\n<p>A dead-serious bowler in a two-tone retro shirt follows through on his roll, eyes narrowed, while the pins explode at the end of the lane. This funny bowling shirt is for the dad, grandpa or teammate who has never missed a Thursday league night and treats the schedule like a vow.</p>\n<p>The print is a 1950s bowling-alley scene: a stern man with slicked hair and a red, teal and mustard bowling shirt, one hand still low from the release, a red ball streaking down the lane toward ten pins tumbling into the air. LEAGUE NIGHT sits above in slab capitals and IS NOT OPTIONAL. below.</p>\n<p>Wear it to league night, the lanes on a Saturday or the family tournament, or hand it to the bowler whose calendar is built around one evening a week. Original art, made for Graphic Tees Co. and printed the day you order it.</p>\n<h3>Details &amp; Fit</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic unisex fit, crew neck</li>\n<li>100% combed, ring-spun cotton (heather colors contain polyester)</li>\n<li>Fabric weight: 4.2 oz/yd² — lightweight</li>\n<li>Pre-shrunk, side-seamed construction, shoulder-to-shoulder taping</li>\n<li>Sizes S–4XL</li>\n<li>Colors: Black, Navy, Dark Grey Heather, Heather Forest, Maroon, Natural, Ash, Athletic Heather</li>\n<li>Blank product sourced from Nicaragua, Honduras, or the US</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Questions</h3>\n<p><strong>What is the League Night Is Not Optional tee?</strong><br>It is a men's graphic tee from Graphic Tees Co. showing a serious 1950s bowler mid follow-through as the pins fly, lettered LEAGUE NIGHT IS NOT OPTIONAL. It is printed on a Bella+Canvas 3001 in 4.2 oz cotton, so it stays light and cool under the alley lights.</p>\n<p><strong>How does the unisex tee fit?</strong><br>This Graphic Tees Co. tee is a true unisex cut in sizes S through 4XL with a crew neck and side-seamed body. Order your usual size for a classic fit or size up one for a looser look. If the size is off, the first exchange is free.</p>\n<p><strong>What is it made of and how do I wash it?</strong><br>The tee is 100% combed, ring-spun cotton, with heather colors blending in some polyester, at a lightweight 4.2 oz. Wash it inside out in cold water with like colors and tumble dry low. That keeps the red, teal and mustard inks crisp wash after wash.</p>\n<p><strong>Is it a good gift for a bowler?</strong><br>Yes. It suits the dad or grandpa with a league ball bag, the teammate who plans around Thursday and anyone who takes a split seriously. It comes from Graphic Tees Co. at $24.99 in eight colors, sizes S through 4XL, and the free size exchange makes it safe as a birthday or league-banquet gift.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I get it by Christmas?</strong><br>Order by about December 8 and your Graphic Tees Co. bowling tee should arrive before Christmas. Each shirt is printed the day you order it, so ship times vary a little by location. Orders over $45 ship free, and the free size exchange covers a wrong guess.</p>\n","seo":{"title":"Funny Bowling Shirt: League Night Is Not Optional","description":"A funny bowling shirt for the league dad: a stern bowler and flying pins. Unisex 4.2 oz cotton tee, S-4XL, printed to order. Free size exchange."},"productOptions":[{"name":"Color","values":[{"name":"Black"},{"name":"Navy"},{"name":"Dark Grey Heather"},{"name":"Heather Forest"},{"name":"Maroon"},{"name":"Natural"},{"name":"Ash"},{"name":"Athletic Heather"}]},{"name":"Size","values":[{"name":"S"},{"name":"M"},{"name":"L"},{"name":"XL"},{"name":"2XL"},{"name":"3XL"},{"name":"4XL"}]}],"variants":[{"optionValues":[{"optionName":"Color","name":"Black"},{"optionName":"Size","name":"S"}],"sku":"mens-bowling-league-night-is-not-optional-graphic-tee